WEBVTT

00:08:27.038 --> 00:08:30.454
and build your confidence to overcome
past struggles and move forward in

00:08:30.454 --> 00:08:31.454
the future.

00:08:34.829 --> 00:08:36.537
When Aaron was searching for a job,

00:08:36.537 --> 00:08:38.871
he decided to take this principle
a step further,

00:08:39.412 --> 00:08:42.704
he started proactively asking interviewers
to call out the elephant in

00:08:42.704 --> 00:08:45.496
the room to tell him what
his disadvantages were.

00:08:45.871 --> 00:08:48.246
Well, first, I want to thank you
for allowing me to come in

00:08:48.246 --> 00:08:51.746
and speak with you. I'm very interested
in this position.

00:08:51.996 --> 00:08:54.912
Is there anything in this
interview or perhaps

00:08:54.912 --> 00:09:00.746
on my résumé that might give you pause
about considering me for the position?